{"id":5520,"date":"2020-12-29T16:09:58","date_gmt":"2020-12-29T15:09:58","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/?p=5520"},"modified":"2022-12-02T11:02:43","modified_gmt":"2022-12-02T10:02:43","slug":"des-masques-aux-couleurs-de-noel","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/des-masques-aux-couleurs-de-noel\/","title":{"rendered":"Des masques aux couleurs de No\u00ebl"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><strong>A l&rsquo;approche des semaines de festivit\u00e9 autour de No\u00ebl et de la nouvelle ann\u00e9e, le Maire Vincent DEBES a distribu\u00e9 des masques aux commer\u00e7ants de proximit\u00e9 et aux passants.<\/strong><!--more--><\/p>\n<p>Ces masques fabriqu\u00e9s par la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 Alsace Production \u00e0 Hoenheim et offerts \u00e0 la collectivit\u00e9 sont d\u00e9cor\u00e9s des th\u00e8mes de No\u00ebl et de la nouvelle ann\u00e9e. Une mani\u00e8re douce et ludique d&rsquo;encourager le port du masque lors des retrouvailles familiales !<\/p>\n<p>Contre la COVID-19, restons prudents.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>A l&rsquo;approche des semaines de festivit\u00e9 autour de No\u00ebl et de la nouvelle ann\u00e9e, le Maire Vincent DEBES a distribu\u00e9 des masques aux commer\u00e7ants de proximit\u00e9 et aux passants.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":5525,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_expiration-date-status":"","_expiration-date":0,"_expiration-date-type":"","_expiration-date-categories":[],"_expiration-date-options":[]},"categories":[31],"tags":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5520"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/6